<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Conrail off, Kmart up.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Conrail off, Kmart up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conrail Inc shares slipped 1-1/4 to 95-1/4 before Wednesday's market open on news that a U.S. court yesterday rejected Norfolk Southern Corp legal attempt to block CSX Corp's friendly merger with Conrail.</p>
<p>Norfolk and CSX shares made no moves before the open.</p>
<p>In U.S. District Court in Philadelphia, all of Norfolk's requests to block the CSX-Conrail merger were denied. The judge said the agreed-to deal does not violate Pennsylvania law.</p>
<p>Norfolk said it will appeal the decision.</p>
</text>
